      "en": "The LORD said to me, “They have well said that which they have spoken.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 내게 이르시되 그들의 말이 옳도다",
      "source_text_hash": "dfebe90834a20025903616cbfcb9d031e13dd557eb2a9375a314027bf70c338f",
      "translation_text_hash": "d420c3d8a5484eb4cdf05776612237dbf53eae040ca422795f91b04e4a01848e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
